Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] motion: hooks for the Apex curve and durations

Hooks for DESIGN's motion, which the Apex layer's motion feature
provides (apex ROADMAP S3c):

- environment.js: a value hook over an ease's parameters in _easeActor
  and _easeAnimatableProperty, through which curved modes become
  Clutter's CUBIC_BEZIER, and a behaviour hook once the transitions
  exist, which sets their control points, since a mode alone takes
  Clutter's;
- windowManager.js, overviewControls.js and boxpointer.js: a value hook
  over the duration of the window size change, of the overview's state
  transitions (in and out, and to and from the app grid) and of a
  popover opening and closing.

adjustAnimationTime still runs after the hooks, so enable-animations
false keeps stock's 0 ms. Without the layer every hook returns stock.
---
 js/ui/boxpointer.js       | 7 +++++--
 js/ui/environment.js      | 7 +++++--
 js/ui/overviewControls.js | 8 ++++----
 js/ui/windowManager.js    | 5 +++--
 4 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

